@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226
@csrf = replace-with-token-from-account-csrf
@videoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@revision = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Obtain CSRF after signing in with the existing account flow; retain cookies.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/csrf

### List current gym videos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos?page=1&pageSize=20&category=exercise

### Upload a local MP4 (adjust the local path before running)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=video-upload

--video-upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Squat demonstration
--video-upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

exercise
--video-upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="exercise.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./exercise.mp4
--video-upload--

### Full playback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos/{{videoId}}/content

### Inclusive range playback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos/{{videoId}}/content
Range: bytes=0-1023

### Replace bytes, retaining metadata (refresh the revision from the result)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos/{{videoId}}/content?expectedRevision={{revision}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=video-replacement

--video-replacement
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="replacement.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./replacement.mp4
--video-replacement--

### Delete using the current revision; repeating an old revision cannot delete a replacement
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos/{{videoId}}?expectedRevision={{revision}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Unsatisfiable range (416 for an existing authorized entry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routines/videos/{{videoId}}/content
Range: bytes=100000001-
